{"html":"<p>Dockerfile 是用于构建 Docker 镜像的脚本文件，包含了用户可以在命令行中调用的所有命令。Docker 可以通过这个脚本生成镜像，设定环境变量，运行指令等。</p>\n<p>通过 <code>docker build</code> 命令读取 <code>Dockerfile</code> 并生成镜像。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dockerfile-基本语法\">Dockerfile 基本语法</h2>\n<h3 id=\"构建命令\">构建命令</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\">docker build -f &lt;dockerfile文件路径&gt; -t &lt;镜像名:TAG&gt; &lt;构建上下文&gt;\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"基本规则\">基本规则</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>指令必须大写</li>\n<li>执行从上到下</li>\n<li><code>#</code> 表示注释</li>\n<li>每个指令都会创建一个镜像层（构建镜像时展示的一行行操作）</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dockerfile-常用指令详解\">Dockerfile 常用指令详解</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-from\">1. FROM</h3>\n<p>指定基础镜像（必须是 Dockerfile 的第一条指令）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> ubuntu:<span class=\"hljs-number\">20.04</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> node:<span class=\"hljs-number\">18</span>-alpine\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> python:<span class=\"hljs-number\">3.10</span>-slim\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-label\">2. LABEL</h3>\n<p>为镜像添加元数据（作者、版本、描述等）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">LABEL</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> maintainer=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;yourname@example.com&quot;</span></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">LABEL</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> version=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;1.0&quot;</span></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">LABEL</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> description=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;这是一个示例镜像&quot;</span></span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-run\">3. RUN</h3>\n<p>执行命令并生成新的镜像层（通常用于安装依赖）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> apt-get update &amp;&amp; apt-get install -y python3 python3-pip</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> npm install</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> pip install -r requirements.txt</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"4-workdir\">4. WORKDIR</h3>\n<p>设置容器内的工作目录（相当于 <code>cd</code>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WORKDIR</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /app</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WORKDIR</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /usr/src/app</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"5-copy--add\">5. COPY &amp; ADD</h3>\n<p>将文件复制到镜像中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># COPY - 仅复制文件/目录</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> ./src /app/src</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> requirements.txt /app/</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># ADD - 可解压 tar 包或下载 URL</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ADD</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> ./app.tar.gz /app/</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ADD</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> https://example.com/file.tar.gz /app/</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>区别</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>COPY</code> 只能复制本地文件</li>\n<li><code>ADD</code> 支持 URL 下载和自动解压</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-env\">6. ENV</h3>\n<p>设置环境变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ENV</span> APP_ENV=production\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ENV</span> PATH=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/usr/local/bin:${PATH}&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ENV</span> NODE_ENV=production\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"7-expose\">7. EXPOSE</h3>\n<p>声明容器对外暴露的端口（仅声明，不自动映射）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">EXPOSE</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">8080</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">EXPOSE</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">3000</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">5000</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"8-volume\">8. VOLUME</h3>\n<p>定义挂载点，用于持久化存储。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">VOLUME</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /var/lib/mysql</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">VOLUME</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/app/data&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/app/logs&quot;</span>]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"9-entrypoint\">9. ENTRYPOINT</h3>\n<p>定义容器的入口命令，通常是主进程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ENTRYPOINT</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;python3&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;app.py&quot;</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ENTRYPOINT</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;java&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;-jar&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;app.jar&quot;</span>]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>为什么需要入口命令？</strong><br>\n容器生命周期管理：容器需要知道启动后要做什么</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应用服务化：将应用程序包装成服务</li>\n<li>标准化部署：统一的启动方式</li>\n<li>资源管理：Docker 可以监控主进程的状态</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"10-cmd\">10. CMD</h3>\n<p>容器启动时默认执行的命令，可以被 <code>docker run</code> 的参数覆盖。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">CMD</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;npm&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;start&quot;</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">CMD</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;python&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;app.py&quot;</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">CMD</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;echo&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Hello World&quot;</span>]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>ENTRYPOINT vs CMD</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>ENTRYPOINT</code> 用于固定入口点（不可轻易被覆盖）</li>\n<li><code>CMD</code> 提供默认参数，可以被覆盖</li>\n<li>可以同时使用：<code>ENTRYPOINT [&quot;python&quot;]</code> + <code>CMD [&quot;app.py&quot;]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"11-arg\">11. ARG</h3>\n<p>构建时参数（仅在 <code>docker build</code> 阶段生效）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ARG</span> APP_VERSION=<span class=\"hljs-number\">1.0</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ARG</span> NODE_VERSION=<span class=\"hljs-number\">18</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Building version <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$APP_VERSION</span>&quot;</span></span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>构建时传递：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\">docker build --build-arg APP_VERSION=2.0 -t myapp:2.0 .\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"12-user\">12. USER</h3>\n<p>指定运行容器时的用户名或 UID。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">USER</span> node\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">USER</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1000</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"13-healthcheck\">13. HEALTHCHECK</h3>\n<p>定义容器健康检查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">HEALTHCHECK</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> --interval=30s --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">timeout</span>=3s --start-period=5s --retries=3 \\\n  CMD curl -f http://localhost:8080/health || <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">exit</span> 1</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"完整示例-dockerfile\">完整示例 Dockerfile</h2>\n<h3 id=\"python-flask-应用\">Python Flask 应用</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 1. 基础镜像</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> python:<span class=\"hljs-number\">3.10</span>-slim\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 2. 镜像信息</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">LABEL</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> maintainer=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;you@example.com&quot;</span></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">LABEL</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> version=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;1.0&quot;</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 3. 设置工作目录</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WORKDIR</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /app</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 4. 设置环境变量</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ENV</span> FLASK_ENV=production\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ENV</span> PYTHONUNBUFFERED=<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 5. 安装系统依赖</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> apt-get update &amp;&amp; apt-get install -y \\\n    gcc \\\n    &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">rm</span> -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 6. 拷贝依赖并安装</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> requirements.txt .</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 7. 拷贝应用代码</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> . .</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 8. 创建非 root 用户</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> useradd --create-home --shell /bin/bash app \\\n    &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">chown</span> -R app:app /app</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">USER</span> app\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 9. 声明端口</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">EXPOSE</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">5000</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 10. 定义卷</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">VOLUME</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /app/data</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 11. 健康检查</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">HEALTHCHECK</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> --interval=30s --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">timeout</span>=3s --start-period=5s --retries=3 \\\n  CMD curl -f http://localhost:5000/health || <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">exit</span> 1</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 12. 启动命令</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">CMD</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;python&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;app.py&quot;</span>]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"nodejs-应用\">Node.js 应用</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 多阶段构建</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> node:<span class=\"hljs-number\">18</span>-alpine AS builder\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WORKDIR</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /app</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> package*.json ./</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> npm ci --only=production</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> node:<span class=\"hljs-number\">18</span>-alpine AS runtime\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WORKDIR</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /app</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> --from=builder /app/node_modules ./node_modules</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> . .</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> addgroup -g 1001 -S nodejs</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> adduser -S nextjs -u 1001</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">USER</span> nextjs\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">EXPOSE</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">3000</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">CMD</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;npm&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;start&quot;</span>]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dockerfile-最佳实践\">Dockerfile 最佳实践</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-选择轻量级基础镜像\">1. 选择轻量级基础镜像</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 推荐</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> python:<span class=\"hljs-number\">3.10</span>-alpine\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> node:<span class=\"hljs-number\">18</span>-alpine\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 避免</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> ubuntu:<span class=\"hljs-number\">20.04</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-合并-run-指令\">2. 合并 RUN 指令</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 推荐 - 减少层数</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> apt-get update &amp;&amp; \\\n    apt-get install -y curl vim &amp;&amp; \\\n    <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">rm</span> -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 避免 - 创建多个层</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> apt-get update</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> apt-get install -y curl vim</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">rm</span> -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"3-使用-dockerignore\">3. 使用 .dockerignore</h3>\n<p>排除不必要的文件<br>\n创建 <code>.dockerignore</code> 文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerignore</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerignore\">.git\nnode_modules\n*.log\n.env\n.DS_Store\ncoverage/\n.nyc_output/\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"4-固定版本\">4. 固定版本</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 推荐 - 固定版本</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> pip install flask==2.3.0</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> node:<span class=\"hljs-number\">18.16</span>.<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>-alpine\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 避免 - 使用 latest</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> node:latest\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> pip install flask</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"5-分阶段构建-multi-stage-builds\">5. 分阶段构建 (Multi-stage builds)</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 构建阶段</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> golang:<span class=\"hljs-number\">1.20</span> AS builder\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WORKDIR</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /build</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> . .</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> go build -o app</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 运行阶段</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> alpine:<span class=\"hljs-number\">3.18</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> apk --no-cache add ca-certificates</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WORKDIR</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> /app</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> --from=builder /build/app .</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">CMD</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;./app&quot;</span>]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"6-优化层缓存\">6. 优化层缓存</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 推荐 - 依赖文件先复制</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> requirements.txt .</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> pip install -r requirements.txt</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> . .</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 避免 - 代码变更导致依赖重新安装</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">COPY</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> . .</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> pip install -r requirements.txt</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"7-使用非-root-用户\">7. 使用非 root 用户</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> addgroup -g 1001 -S nodejs</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">RUN</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> adduser -S nextjs -u 1001</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">USER</span> nextjs\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"8-设置健康检查\">8. 设置健康检查</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>dockerfile</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-dockerfile\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">HEALTHCHECK</span><span class=\"language-bash\"> --interval=30s --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">timeout</span>=3s --start-period=5s --retries=3 \\\n  CMD curl -f http://localhost:8080/health || <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">exit</span> 1</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见问题\">常见问题</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-如何减小镜像大小\">1. 如何减小镜像大小？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 Alpine 基础镜像</li>\n<li>多阶段构建</li>\n<li>清理缓存和临时文件</li>\n<li>使用 .dockerignore</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-如何提高构建速度\">2. 如何提高构建速度？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>合理利用层缓存</li>\n<li>并行安装依赖</li>\n<li>使用构建缓存</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-如何调试-dockerfile\">3. 如何调试 Dockerfile？</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 构建时查看详细输出</span>\ndocker build --no-cache -t myapp .\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># 进入容器调试</span>\ndocker run -it myapp /bin/bash\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2>\n<p>Dockerfile 是容器化应用的核心配置文件，掌握其语法和最佳实践对于构建高效、安全的 Docker 镜像至关重要。通过合理使用各种指令和遵循最佳实践，可以创建出高质量的生产级镜像。</p>\n","toc":[{"level":2,"text":"Dockerfile 基本语法","id":"dockerfile-基本语法"},{"level":3,"text":"构建命令","id":"构建命令"},{"level":3,"text":"基本规则","id":"基本规则"},{"level":2,"text":"Dockerfile 常用指令详解","id":"dockerfile-常用指令详解"},{"level":3,"text":"1. FROM","id":"1-from"},{"level":3,"text":"2. LABEL","id":"2-label"},{"level":3,"text":"3. RUN","id":"3-run"},{"level":3,"text":"4. WORKDIR","id":"4-workdir"},{"level":3,"text":"5. COPY & ADD","id":"5-copy--add"},{"level":3,"text":"6. ENV","id":"6-env"},{"level":3,"text":"7. EXPOSE","id":"7-expose"},{"level":3,"text":"8. VOLUME","id":"8-volume"},{"level":3,"text":"9. ENTRYPOINT","id":"9-entrypoint"},{"level":3,"text":"10. CMD","id":"10-cmd"},{"level":3,"text":"11. ARG","id":"11-arg"},{"level":3,"text":"12. USER","id":"12-user"},{"level":3,"text":"13. HEALTHCHECK","id":"13-healthcheck"},{"level":2,"text":"完整示例 Dockerfile","id":"完整示例-dockerfile"},{"level":3,"text":"Python Flask 应用","id":"python-flask-应用"},{"level":3,"text":"Node.js 应用","id":"nodejs-应用"},{"level":2,"text":"Dockerfile 最佳实践","id":"dockerfile-最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 选择轻量级基础镜像","id":"1-选择轻量级基础镜像"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 合并 RUN 指令","id":"2-合并-run-指令"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 使用 .dockerignore","id":"3-使用-dockerignore"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 固定版本","id":"4-固定版本"},{"level":3,"text":"5. 分阶段构建 (Multi-stage builds)","id":"5-分阶段构建-multi-stage-builds"},{"level":3,"text":"6. 优化层缓存","id":"6-优化层缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"7. 使用非 root 用户","id":"7-使用非-root-用户"},{"level":3,"text":"8. 设置健康检查","id":"8-设置健康检查"},{"level":2,"text":"常见问题","id":"常见问题"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 如何减小镜像大小？","id":"1-如何减小镜像大小"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 如何提高构建速度？","id":"2-如何提高构建速度"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 如何调试 Dockerfile？","id":"3-如何调试-dockerfile"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}]}